{
  "description": "Forgejo's swagger marks no response field as required, but its structs always send these: `Repository` in modules/structs/repo.go and `User.UserName` in modules/structs/user.go have no `omitempty` (forgejo/forgejo v17.0.1, read 2026-11-01). Without this, a repository's id and name are optional on every read, and callers would have to invent values for what is always there.",
